TITLE Albite kinetic dissolution with H2S gas at 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    redox pe
    Fe(3) 0.004
    Fe(2) 0.004
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m 1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -step true
    -totals Fe Na S Al
END
